IaLfLy-wkJiUJu0h4TO8Ybn4N4KQ&oe=6AFC6CDD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560-1440i.png", "id": "1356757789265914", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831778_1356757792599247_4587322783342260855_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HTIWtnXFDY0Q7kNvwF1Eq5V&_nc_oc=Adrd5CBOaCyYmWo3PqgIOdSa2j0iNUTJayQ5Ji6Y_0MUgt7d1ciKLYExp6mYIJTP4S4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTa9IcRn24uud4Zmu_vRnfU6YyqvtiFk28bK4n1QWbCzQ&oe=6AFC8392"}, "display_name": "Angelino Drift", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Angelino Drift** is an open-world driving sandbox set in the dark, neon-lit streets of Angelino City. \n\nEvery day, a live bomb is hidden somewhere in the city, and **it\u2019s up to you to find it before time runs out.**\n\nYou play as sharp-tongued Marie and her new driver, tearing through the city at full speed. \n\n# \"Drifting is the core of everything you do!\"\n\n{2241587696326965}\n\nSlide through corners to maintain momentum, shoot enemy vehicles, and smash through traffic and obstacles without taking damage. \n\n**While drifting, your car becomes unstoppable, turning the city itself into a weapon.**\n\nThis is a game about control versus chaos. Drive clean to stay alive, or embrace destruction to clear your path. **Every second counts**, every corner matters, and hesitation is the fastest way to fail.\n\nIf you love open-world driving, stylish drifting, explosive shooting, and sandbox freedom, **Angelino Drift** delivers a tight, adrenaline-charged experience where momentum is survival.\n\n{1373788140951519}", "short_description": "An open-world driving sandbox where drifting turns you into a high-speed weapon. Race against time, shoot rival cars, smash through the city, and keep the bomb from detonating."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://support2358.wixsite.com/chopple/privacy", "developer_terms_o